        'The starter code has the disk queue [82, 170, 43, 140, 24, 16, 190] and the head at 50. Run SSTF and find the order and total movement. Run the code and verify the order is [43, 24, 16, 82, 140, 170, 190]. Done-condition: the output shows "Total head movement: 208".'
